# Business Rules

## Rule 1

A Title Review cannot begin until the PSA is fully executed.

---

## Rule 2

Every identified title defect must be classified.

---

## Rule 3

Deals with unresolved Curative items cannot move to Closing.

---

## Rule 4

Only Title Attorneys or Administrators may approve a completed Title Review.

---

## Rule 5

Every review action is recorded in the audit log.

